<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 5,150 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 126.75 pence a kilo against 129.91 last week and 107.87 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 46,912 pkgs sold so far this year is 118.80 pence against 113.77 pence for the 56,634 kgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
